    "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Hi everyone,\n\nI’m based in the South of France. I’m the Founder & CEO of Squared. We design, market, sell, and deliver mastermind events for entrepreneurs.My goal in this program is to upgrade our operations by adding an AI layer on top of EOS, starting with marketing launches (main bottleneck) and program delivery, and eventually extending AI across the entire organization.I was drawn to AI for its leverage and operational impact. I discovered Empower through a YouTube conversation between Tiago Forte and Hayden last summer, which clarified how AI could become a real operating system rather than just a set of tools.\n\nGlad to be here.",
